flowchart LR
    subgraph Routes[Explicit kind routes]
        I[impl]
        D[design]
        R[review-impl]
    end
    subgraph Bindings[Author-defined bindings]
        L[lead]
        V[review]
    end
    subgraph Commands[Reusable commands]
        A[agent-a template]
        B[agent-b template]
    end
    I --> L
    D --> L
    R --> V
    L -->|selected binding| A
    V -->|selected binding| B
    P[Alternative profile] -. changes binding targets .-> Bindings
    E[Parameter-only profile] -. changes one named value .-> Commands
